-"AI-Toolkit only. Every song is first split into voice and instrumental; the music half then also learns the voice from the lyrics alone and the music from the tags alone.": "仅限 AI-Toolkit。每首歌先分离成人声和伴奏；然后音乐一半还会只凭歌词学人声，只凭标签学音乐。",
+"Every song is first split into voice and instrumental (the studio's separator, once a set: minutes a song); the music half then also learns the voice from the lyrics alone and the music from the tags alone.": "每首歌先分离成人声和伴奏（用工作室的分离器，每个数据集一次：每首几分钟）；然后音乐一半还会只凭歌词学人声，只凭标签学音乐。",
 "The language model that drafts the brief (title, style and lyrics). Any instruction-following model works; a bigger one writes better lyrics, a smaller one answers faster.": "起草简报（标题、风格和歌词）的语言模型。任何能遵循指令的模型都可以；越大写的歌词越好，越小回答越快。",
 "The /v1 address of a chat server that is already running, for the idea writer. The page uses whatever model it has loaded; it never loads, switches or unloads a model there.": "已经在运行的聊天服务器的 /v1 地址，供想法写作使用。页面使用它已加载的模型；从不在那里加载、切换或卸载模型。",
 "Retake: this exact take into the form, with its score, both seeds and its music codes. Generate renders the same music again: try another VAE, sound seed or sound variations": "重录：把这个录音原样放进表单，带上它的乐谱、两个种子和音乐编码。“生成”会再次渲染同样的音乐：试试别的 VAE、声音种子或声音变体",
