-"Ruach Studio: the studio's own trainer, on the full bf16 weights, Direct or with a score. AI-Toolkit (Ostris): the reference; it can also train on separated vocals. Both save the same LoRA format.": "Ruach Studio：工作室自己的训练器，用完整的 bf16 权重，直接模式或带乐谱。AI-Toolkit（Ostris）：参考实现；也能在分离出的人声上训练。两者保存相同的 LoRA 格式。",
+"Ruach Studio: the studio's own trainer, on the full bf16 weights: Direct or with a score, on the songs as they are or split into voice and music. Ported from Ostris' AI-Toolkit (MIT), which left the studio once all it trained was here.": "Ruach Studio：工作室自己的训练器，用完整的 bf16 权重：直接模式或带乐谱，可用原曲，也可把歌分成人声和音乐来训练。移植自 Ostris 的 AI-Toolkit（MIT）；它能训练的一切都到了这里之后，它便离开了工作室。",
 "UniverSR redraws the top of the spectrum after Debuzz: subtle above 12 kHz, normal above 8, high above 6. One variant, the original kept below the cutoff; about 1.6 times the length of the song on a 3090.": "UniverSR 在去嗡声之后重绘频谱高端：轻微为 12 kHz 以上，普通为 8 以上，高为 6 以上。一个变体，截止频率以下保留原声；在 3090 上约为歌曲时长的 1.6 倍。",
